# GRUB SHIFT: fizz pods fall on random tiles (never on Tilly or a grub).
# One that falls into a pit is lost; a third pod on a tile blows it open
# into a sinkhole and blasts the tiles around it - so it's dangerous to
# stand next to a tile holding two. Every other tile here is sour, so the
# four pods of RESTOCK have only one place to go.
game grubshift
wait 5
cheat contract 1 7
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat pods 3 2 2
cheat bug 4 2 1 0
cheat sour 1 0 1
cheat sour 2 0 1
cheat sour 3 0 1
cheat sour 4 0 1
cheat sour 5 0 1
cheat sour 0 1 1
cheat sour 1 1 1
cheat sour 2 1 1
cheat sour 3 1 1
cheat sour 4 1 1
cheat sour 5 1 1
cheat sour 0 2 1
cheat sour 1 2 1
cheat sour 2 2 1
cheat sour 5 2 1
cheat sour 0 3 1
cheat sour 1 3 1
cheat sour 2 3 1
cheat sour 3 3 1
cheat sour 4 3 1
cheat sour 5 3 1
cheat sour 0 4 1
cheat sour 1 4 1
cheat sour 2 4 1
cheat sour 3 4 1
cheat sour 4 4 1
cheat sour 5 4 1
cheat chip 6 35
cheat use 6 0 0
expect hole_at32 == 1
expect kills == 1
expect status == 0
cheat clear
cheat tilly 0 0
cheat hole 3 2
cheat sour 1 0 1
cheat sour 2 0 1
cheat sour 3 0 1
cheat sour 4 0 1
cheat sour 5 0 1
cheat sour 0 1 1
cheat sour 1 1 1
cheat sour 2 1 1
cheat sour 3 1 1
