cheat sour 5 3 1
cheat sour 0 4 1
cheat sour 1 4 1
cheat sour 2 4 1
cheat sour 3 4 1
cheat sour 4 4 1
cheat sour 5 4 1
cheat chip 5 35
cheat use 5 0 0
